  "body": "## What's new in v2.5.24-dev.9-alpha7\n\n- ext: run the maintainer scripts, instead of announcing that we never will\n- installer: only real disks in the picker, and a browser that lands on the installer\n- ext: the apt shim must not exist for the build, only for a running appliance\n- ext: upgrading an add-on, and an apt upgrade that does what it can\n- ci: create the release once, when it is complete - drafts do not work here\n- iso: ask the build host only for the tools the chosen mode uses\n",
